nt mentions Purchase, New York, as their address, reinforcing the town's status as a hub for major business entities.", "SARAH JOHNSON:Sarah Johnson is the contact person and Procurement Manager for Tesla, Inc.", "GLOVIS SOLOMON:Glovis Solomon is the buyer in the procurement agreement, located at 456 Logistics Lane, Seoul, South Korea", "DAVID KIM:David Kim is the contact person and Supply Chain Director for Glovis Solomon", "SEOUL, SOUTH KOREA:Seoul, South Korea is the location of Glovis Solomon's address and is also the location of Hyundai Glovis, the buyer in the procurement agreement.", "SOUTH KOREA:South Korea is the country where Hyundai Glovis, Hyundai Motor Group, and Glovis Solomon are located. It is also a place where there are rising concerns over the safety of electric vehicle batteries.", "MICHAEL WILSON:Michael Wilson is the contact person and Procurement Manager for Tesla, Inc.", "SMART WATCHES:Smart Watches are the product being supplied under the procurement agreement", "ISO 9001:2015:ISO 9001:2015 is the quality management standard that the products must comply with.", "OCTOBER 29, 2023:The effective date of the procurement agreement"], "parameters": {"model": "text-embedding-3-small", "temperature": 0.0, "frequency_penalty": null, "presence_penalty": null, "top_p": 1.0, "max_tokens": 4000, "n": 1}, "history": null}